<title>JAPAN: Japan Tobacco to tie up with U.S. biotech venture.</title>
<headline>Japan Tobacco to tie up with U.S. biotech venture.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Tobacco Inc (JT) said on Friday it had agreed with Tularik Inc, a biotechnology venture in the United States, to jointly seek substances for the manufacture of drugs to reduce obesity and treat diabetes.</p>
<p>No other information was available and a spokesmen for JT was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
